(3409,'asso','Houston de Robillard','houstonderob@mac.com',NULL,'Bonjour Adele,  I have recently moved to Latresne and would be interested in teaching English, were you to need an extra teacher at any time.  In France we have had a small vineyard so have some familiarity with the wine industry.  While living in Singapore I did the CELTA course. I have a Masters in Educational Studies and a Nursing background.  I have taught Education and Nursing at University level and English to children.\r\nIf you would like to talk to me, please call any time. \r\nKind regards \r\nJacqui Houston.',0,0,1),
